# Lower bounds on the weak-closure parameter

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
manuscript (1 March 2004), §E.6, printed pp.244–258.

The source setup, normalizer consequences and selection of minimal
centralizer obstructions are supplied here, together with Proposition E.6.27
over the complete known-simple catalogue. Its original centralizer bound
uses the proved small-parabolic estimate and the reflected Cartan construction;
sharp generation at one excludes the paired odd-prime PSL₂ row.
The structural analysis of centralizers and the lower-bound theorem E.6.3
remain separate proof obligations; the hypotheses contain none of their
conclusions.
-/
